OL,3,GNEWSAUlster Unionists launch
OL,4,Asafeguarding review into sex offender
OL,5,ADonaldson
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Ulster Unionist Party (UUP) has
OL,8,Flaunched an independent safeguarding
OL,9,Freview into sex offender Jeffrey
OL,10,FDonaldson's conduct during his 21-year
OL,11,Fmembership of the party.
OL,13,FThe former MP was convicted in June of
OL,14,F18 counts of sex abuse including one
OL,15,Fcount of rape, which he committed
OL,16,Fagainst two women when they were
OL,17,Fchildren. Donaldson is seeking to
OL,18,Fappeal.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
