OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUlster Unionists launch
OL,4,Asafeguarding review into sex offender
OL,5,ADonaldson
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was a member of the UUP between 1982
OL,8,Fand 2003 before joining and later
OL,9,Fbecoming leader of the Democratic
OL,10,FUnionist Party (DUP).
OL,12,FThe UUP said the review will be led by
OL,13,Fsafeguarding consultant Anne Marks with
OL,14,Fsupport from an advisory group of
OL,15,Findependent victim advocates.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
